This module gathers and re-exports the constants and functor expressions of Exercise 6.22. The two-point domain has neighbourhoods {0} and {0, Λ}, the one-point domain is {{Λ}}, the vertical-naturals expression is the coalesced sum of the two-point domain with the variable, the lazy-naturals expression is the separated sum of the one-point domain with the variable, and the stream expression is the coalesced sum of a datum domain N with the smash product of N and the variable.
